      "message": "From an API perspective, how easy would it be to change this to a List? Although today it only allows for the enterprise capability, that\u0027s quite possible to change? If so, we would want to extend that for \u0027n\u0027 capabilities, each with their own request evaluated in order before falling back to the system default network?\n\nE.g., if you had a list of 2 requests:\n\n    if 1 is available use it\n    else if 2 is available use it\n    else use the system default\n\nAnd so on and so forth (perhaps cap it at some arbitrary number)...\n\nIt show be fairly trivial to implement now that multilayered network requests are complete? Now of course, that\u0027s assuming you are ok with this behavior which may not be the case however if so, it would make this API more flexible.",
